    "text": "Hey folks :wave: _OLake v1.0 is out!_ :tada: We’re hosting a live session to walk through what’s new.\n\n:spiral_calendar_pad: _Thu, 26 Nov · 8:30 pm IST / 10 am ET / 3 pm GMT / 7 am PT · 1 hour_\nWhat we’ll cover:\n• _Streams V2:_ why we split `streams.json` and what changes in your configs. Worth catching before you upgrade.\n• _Live demo:_ creating a Kafka → Iceberg upsert job through GitOps, end to end\n• _Snapshot expiry in OLake Fusion:_ keeping your Iceberg tables from growing without limit\n• _Open Q\u0026amp;A for the rest of the hour:_ bring your weird edge cases, the engineers who built it will be there\nGrab a spot here :point_right: \u003chttps://luma.com/olake-3y9w?utm_source=slack_olake\u0026amp;utm_medium=community\u0026amp;utm_campaign=webinar_26nov|luma.com/olake-3y9w?…\u003e\n\nAlready tried v1.0, or stuck on something? Drop it in the thread and we’ll answer it live :raised_hands:",
